d He brought you to life; then He will cause you to die, then He will bring you [back] to life, and then to Him you will be returned.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"2:29","t":"It is He who created for you all of that which is on the earth. Then He directed Himself to the heaven, [His being above all creation], and made them seven heavens, and He is Knowing of all things.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":29,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":1,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}